      "title": "Evaluate the familiar values",
      "body": "<p>Use standard trig angles and the definition of a logarithm to work out any exact values you recognise.</p>",
      "recap": "Use exact standard-angle values and their quadrant signs.",
      "pitfall": "A power of a sine value is different from multiplying its angle. Keep quadrant signs.",
      "pause": "Write down the values you can find exactly.",
