  ],
  "solution": "<p>The first three options have values <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#x0002C;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>. The fourth satisfies <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>10</mn><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></math> because <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></math>.</p><p>The fifth lies between 0 and 1 because <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#x02212;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x0003C;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>. The fourth is therefore largest. <strong>Answer D.</strong></p>",
